# Performance

Measure with DevTools before changing code. Match the tool to the symptom:

| Symptom | Tool |
|---|---|
| Jank / dropped frames | Performance view (build + raster of that interaction) |
| Heap growth / leak | Memory view, navigate in/out of the screen |
| Slow cold start | time-to-interactive; work before first frame |
| App size | `flutter build --analyze-size` |

Targets: 60 FPS (no frame over ~16 ms on the main isolate). Cold start under ~2 s.

Fixes already prescribed — do not invent a parallel pattern:

- Extra rebuilds → `const`, `select()`, smaller widgets
- Sync work > ~16 ms → `compute()` / `Isolate.spawn()`
- Images → `cached_network_image`, `cacheWidth` / `cacheHeight`
- Large lists → pagination / windowing (`ListView.builder`), not dumping the full collection into a `Column`

A change with no better after-measurement is not an optimization — revert it.
